# Build context hygiene. Without this, `az acr build .` from the repo root uploads ~9GB — the
# corpus alone is 8.4GB — and the client hangs before the build is even submitted. The ingestion
# image needs src/, scripts/add_one_to_lode.py and api/ and nothing else.
corpus/
data/
.git/
.github/
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
tests/
docs/
db/
dashboard/
*.log
.env
.venv/
